gnorc_cove | pos=(36863, 117108, 30800) yaw=1448 pitch=343
# gnorc_cove aerial vista, LP-dominated. The .s's per-half LP NCLIP backface
# test drops a scattered ~4.7k px of faces here (OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CULL=1 draws
# them and lands FURTHER from og), and its verdict is a 2D cross over
# GTE-projected corners, so which faces drop shifts under small yaw changes.
# This pins the mirror at one angle, where og and the native path agree
# structurally and differ only on edge pixels.
#
# The knife edge cuts both ways: this pose's golden is the only one in the
# corpus that has ever needed re-capturing without a code change behind it.
# Its first PNGs matched no reachable build - three independent binaries
# (the bless commit's own, a later one, and a second checkout's) agreed
# byte-for-byte with each other and differed from those PNGs by the same
# 41/19/78/39 px, while the two sibling gnorc_cove poses matched exactly.
# The replacements are that consensus. A scattered divergence here is a
# real verdict flip and worth chasing; it is not capture noise.
gnorc_cove | pos=(40035, 93020, 48414) yaw=394 pitch=475
